After conversion, copy skin_lesion_b4.tflite into this folder:

    cp ../../../skin_lesion_b4.tflite skin_lesion_b4.tflite

The .tflite file (~40 MB after fp16 quantization) is gitignored — see
project root .gitignore. The build.gradle.kts in this app already sets
`androidResources { noCompress += "tflite" }` so TFLite can mmap it.
